ow() WHERE slug='sxth-element-engineering' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Sabroso Foods operates from Albuquerque, New Mexico, where it has been family-owned and operated since its founding in 1987. The company began with a mission to supply the freshest and most authentic New Mexican products, a focus that has remained unchanged for over three decades.

The business runs a tortilleria that produces fresh tortillas, prepared foods, and chile products cooked daily in-house without harsh chemicals or preservatives. It serves both retail walk-in customers and wholesale buyers, offering wholesale pricing on its full product line.

Customers regularly purchase items like tamales, posole, and tortillas made on-site, reflecting the company''s role as a local food manufacturer and distributor.

