UPDATE companies SET description='Salt Lake Cable & Harness, Inc. operates from North Salt Lake, Utah. The company has been active in contract manufacturing for over 30 years, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed. Ownership details and founder names have not been shared in the available materials.

The company produces custom cable assemblies, wire harnesses, and electromechanical assemblies, including box builds, injection-molded parts, potting, and wire cut-strip-pin services. It runs automated inserting systems, cutting machines, stripping equipment, and crimping presses, and handles volumes from small complex runs to high simple volumes, with a focus on low-to-medium volume, high-mix production. Engineering development builds are offered before full production.

Customers span medical, aerospace, military/defense, automotive, industrial, and telecommunications sectors. In medical, the firm builds cables for diagnostic systems and equipment used worldwide. For aerospace and defense, it serves Department of Defense subcontractors with AS9100D and ITAR-compliant assemblies, including Spec 3 IPC builds. Automotive work includes OBDII cable molds and switch harnesses, while industrial projects range from high-end coffee machines to control systems.

Salt Lake Cable emphasizes a culture of quality backed by ISO 9001:2015 and AS9100D certification, ITAR registration, and employee training to IPC/WHMA-A-620 standards. The company cites superior quality, customer service, and on-time delivery as core value drivers, and offers a 100% product guarantee.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','AS9100D','ITAR registered']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cable assemblies", "Wire harness assemblies", "Electromechanical box builds", "Prototyping services", "Potting", "Injection molding", "Wire cut, strip, and pin", "Electrical assemblies", "Testing and quality assurance", "Engineering development builds", "RoHS-compatible wiring", "UL-compliant wiring", "Lead-free wiring", "High-speed data cables", "Complex harnesses", "Simple jumpers", "Power cables", "Automated inserting", "Crimping", "Stripping", "Cutting"], "industries": ["Medical", "Aerospace", "Military/Defense", "Automotive", "Industrial", "Telecommunications", "Space"], "materials": ["Wire", "Cable", "Tubing", "Connectors", "Epoxy", "Silicone"], "equipment": ["Automated inserting systems", "Cutting machines", "Stripping machines", "Crimping presses", "High-precision wire-cutting machines"], "volume": "Small complex runs to high simple volumes; low to medium volume, high mix production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["AS9100D and ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system", "ITAR registered for defense work", "Spec 3 IPC/WHMA-A-620 build capability", "Low-to-medium volume, high-mix production focus", "100% product guarantee with in-house testing"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: North Salt Lake, Utah -> db", "Over 30 years in contract manufacturing -> /", "Custom cable assemblies, wire harnesses, electromechanical assemblies -> /", "Capabilities: box builds, injection molding, potting, wire cut/strip/pin -> /capabilities", "Equipment: automated inserting systems, cutting machines, stripping, crimping presses, high-precision wire-cutting machines -