UPDATE companies SET description='Sanko Gosei Technologies USA, Inc. operates a manufacturing facility in Fort Wayne, Indiana, serving as the U.S. arm of a global organization focused on thermoplastic injection molding. The company runs over 40 injection molding machines with clamping forces ranging from 200 to 3,500 tons, supported by a workforce of approximately 180 employees. This equipment base enables production of a wide variety of plastic components with flexibility across part sizes and complexities.

The facility specializes in thermoplastic injection molding for automotive applications, producing components for vehicle manufacturers and tier suppliers. Its technical expertise is built on experience across multiple sectors, though automotive remains the core market highlighted in its public materials. The company emphasizes advanced machinery and systems to maintain a competitive edge in delivery and design support.

Sanko Gosei Technologies USA positions continuous investment in state-of-the-art equipment and highly skilled professionals as its primary differentiator. This strategy aims to tackle manufacturing challenges, reduce costs, and enhance part designs for customers. The company describes its approach as mastering cutting-edge technology to deliver tailored solutions that meet evolving automotive industry demands.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Thermoplastic injection molding", "Injection molding (200\u20133,500 ton capacity)", "Automotive component manufacturing", "Advanced plastic injection molding", "State-of-the-art machinery operation", "Skilled workforce development"], "industries": ["Automotive"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Injection molding machines (200\u20133,500 ton capacity)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 40 injection molding machines (200\u20133,500 ton capacity)", "Thermoplastic injection molding expertise for automotive components", "Continuous investment in state-of-the-art machinery and skilled personnel", "Focus on innovation to reduce costs and enhance designs", "U.S. facility with advanced plastic injection molding systems"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Sanko Gosei Technologies USA, Inc. -> db", "Location: Fort Wayne, Indiana -> db", "Employee count: 180 -> db", "Process: Thermoplastic injection molding -> /capabilities", "Machine count: Over 40 injection molding machines -> /capabilities", "Machine capacity range: 200 to 3500 ton -> /capabilities", "Industry served: Automotive -> /capabilities", "Differentiator: Continuous investment in state-of-the-art machinery and skilled professionals -> /capabilities", "Differentiator: Innovation to tackle challenges, reduce costs, enhance designs -> /capabilities"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Sanko Gosei Technologies USA Inc, leverages thermoplastic injection molding to produce a wide r