UPDATE companies SET description='SESCO is an electrical contract manufacturer headquartered in Mont Alto, Pennsylvania. Founded in 1983 by David Souders, the company began as a small wire harness operation and has grown into a full-service manufacturing partner operating an 88,000-square-foot facility in the state.

The company designs, prototypes, and manufactures custom electrical assemblies including wire harnesses, cable assemblies, control panels, and box builds. It supports programs from concept through full-scale production, offering in-house engineering, testing, supply chain management, and new product introduction services.

SESCO serves OEMs and industrial customers across sectors such as defense, data centers, and general industrial markets. Its products are used in military systems supporting U.S. service members, and the company highlights its UL 508A-listed control panels for data center applications. The customer base includes innovative companies requiring end-to-end contract manufacturing.

