UPDATE companies SET description='SkyWater Technology is headquartered in Bloomington, Minnesota. The company was formed in 2017 when it acquired the Bloomington fabrication facility originally established by Cypress Semiconductor in 1991. SkyWater operates as a wholly owned subsidiary of IonQ and is described as the largest exclusively U.S.-based semiconductor foundry with no foreign controlling interest.

The company provides semiconductor foundry services including wafer manufacturing, advanced packaging, and technology development across three U.S. facilities. Its flagship Bloomington fab offers 91,000 square feet of Class 10 cleanroom space with 200 mm equipment supporting 90 nm and larger geometries. The Kissimmee, Florida facility adds 36,000 square feet of Class 1,000 and 10,000 cleanroom space with 200/300 mm equipment for advanced packaging and heterogeneous integration. The Austin, Texas fab (acquired in 2025) provides 114,000 square feet of Class 1 cleanroom, 30,000 square feet of probe and test area, and 200 mm equipment capable of 65 nm geometries. SkyWater’s process portfolio spans CMOS, MEMS, photonics, superconducting devices, rad-hard technologies, and read-out integrated circuits (ROICs).

SkyWater serves customers in quantum computing, automotive, aerospace and defense, high-performance computing and AI, industrial, and biomedical markets. Its customer base includes fabless semiconductor companies, integrated device manufacturers (IDMs), original equipment manufacturers (OEMs), startups, government agencies, and research organizations. Notable partnerships include collaboration with IonQ on quantum processors and the ThermaView™ product line for advanced ROICs used in aerospace, defense, automotive, and industrial applications.

SkyWater differentiates itself through a collaborative foundry model branded as Technology-as-a-Service (TaaS), which aims to accelerate the path from concept to production. The company emphasizes secure, domestic manufacturing to support resilient supply chains and national technology leadership, and it holds DMEA accreditation as a supplier for defense applications.', certifications=ARRAY['AS 9100']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wafer manufacturing", "Advanced packaging", "Heterogeneous integration", "MEMS fabrication", "Photonics fabrication", "Superconducting device fabrication", "Rad-hard by process", "CMOS fabrication", "ROIC manufacturing", "Multi-Project Wafer (MPW) services", "Technology-as-a-Service (TaaS)", "Quantum solutions development", "Technology development", "High-volume production", "Probe and test"], "industries": ["Quantum Computing", "Automotive", "Aerospace and Defense", "High-Performance Computing and AI", "Industrial", "Biomedical"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["200 mm wafer processing equipment", "300 mm wafer processing equipment", "Class 1 cleanroom", "Class 10 cleanroom", "Class 1,000 cleanroom", "Class 10,000 cleanroom", "Probe and test equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Largest exclusively U.S.-based semiconductor foundry with no foreign controlling interest", "Technology-as-a-Service (TaaS) engagement model for accelerated development", "Multi-Project Wafer (MPW) services for low-cost, rapid prototyping", "DMEA-accredited Trusted supplier for defense and aerospace", "Three domestic fabrication facilities supporting 200 mm and 300 mm processing"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Bloomington, Minnesota -> /about-us", "Founded in 2017 via acquisition of Cypress Semiconductor facility -> /about-us", "Wholly owned subsidiary of IonQ -> /about-us", "Three U.S. fabrication facilities (Bloomington, Kissimmee, Austin) -> /about-us", "Facility sizes and cleanroom classes -> /about-us", "Process portfolio: CMOS, MEMS, photonics, superconducting, rad-hard, ROICs -> /about-us and /", "Industries served: quantum computing, automotive, aerospace & defense, HPC/AI, industrial, biomedical -> /about-us and /services", "Technology-as-a-Service (TaaS) model -> / and /services", "Multi-Project Wafer services -> / and /services", "DMEA-accredited Trusted supplier -> db (description)", "Certifications: ISO9001, AS9100, ISO13485, ISO14001, IATF16949 -> db", "Largest exclusively U.S.-based foundry with no foreign controlling interest -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "SkyWater is a U.S.-based semiconductor manufacturer and foundry that partners closely with customers to deliver reliable, production-ready microchips", "founded_year": "2017", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='skywater-technology' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
